{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tfH5o3aEO21795701752.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>旺角有工人在大廈棚架被燒傷。</p><p></p><p>消防滅火後，繼續向懷疑起火點射水降溫。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MK.FIRE-2000_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Y9tymWnDHU1795702132.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現場是旺角登打士街89至91號。警方稱下午5時許接報，大廈外牆圍網冒煙。初步調查相信，一名55歲男工人在棚架工作時意外燒傷，火花懷疑濺中圍網，他手及小腿燒傷，清醒送院。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MK.FIRE-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sbHQlJkoiA1795701763.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現階段無證據顯示涉及刑事成分。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.635112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T01:37:13.412413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:37:20.173418+00:00","content_hash":"5c76b9bbac16e43a46596394dfa326eff6cc1380671b9b1cc4a5458fa7454a65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:43:59.635112+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}